# Missions: a trick step (tricks: a banked combo holding a kickflip, near Rosa within 40 m). The Big 3
# kickflip (soma-big3-kickflip) banks Kickflip + BIG 3 GAP 25 m from her: the step is done, and the
# next talk step (radius 40) starts her line at once.
park soma
spawn big3
cmd 0 mission start ch1 2
hold up 0..100
hold ollie 166..196
tap flip+left 202
run 420
expect event missionStep{mission=ch1,step=2,kind=trick} within 1..1
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip + BIG 3 GAP} within 300..360
expect event missionStep{mission=ch1,step=3,kind=talk} within 300..360
expect event talk{character=rosa,line=ch1-06,n=0} within 300..360
expect no event bail
